TIER: mid — second-stage, ~2-4 ft tall
COMPLEXITY BUDGET: 2 signature elements total (e.g., a head feature AND one body feature — but not also a cape, also markings, also accessories)
SILHOUETTE: clearer limbs, distinguishable features, some asymmetry allowed
PROPORTIONS: balanced; head-to-body ratio closer to realistic but still slightly cute
COLOR: 3-4 zones maximum
POSTURE: grounded and alert, confident but not imposing
PRESENCE: capable but not impressive
DO NOT: add capes, mantles, multi-layered features, flowing fur or hair, glowing auras, floral sprays, elaborate appendages, or more than one accent per body region. This is an awkward teenager, not a final form.
